<title>OMAN: Gulf Investment Services in maiden results.</title>
<headline>Gulf Investment Services in maiden results.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period from May 21, 1995 to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		     (Omani rials unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit					 368,441</p>
<p>    Pre-tax					    385,691</p>
<p>    Retained earnings at end of period	 331,597</p>
<p>    Commission income				342,063</p>
<p>    Other income				     428,308</p>
<p>    Interest paid				    227,396</p>
<p>    Total assets				   8.93 million</p>
<p>Full name: Gulf Investment Services SAOG</p>
<p>Note: The company's principal activity is brokerage.</p>
</text>
